CHILLAYI YE ZAINAB MERA MAARA GAYA BHAYI ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
 EK DIN MEIN MILI KHAAK MEIN ZEHRA KI KAMAI ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
<br>
SAR PAR NA RAHA KOI JO BEWAON KO BACHAYE AADA HAIN DAR,<br>
 AYE AB MAUT HI AAJAYE TO HO SAB KI REHAYEE ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
<br>
HAIN AAG LAGI JAYE KAHAN MOO KO CHUPANE BACHAON KO BACCHANE,<br>
 BEEMAR KO ZALIM NE HAI ZANJEER PEHNAYI ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
<br>
BHABI SE CHHUPA JAATA HAI BESHEER KA JHOOLA NANNA WO SHALOOKA,<br>
 PAANI KE EWAZ TEER SE HAI PYAAS BUJHAYI ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
<br>
NADAA KE GOHAR CHHIN GAYE AUR KAAN HAIN ZAKHMI BACCHI HAIN TADAPTI,<br>
 WAARIS JO NAHI SAR PE TO DUSHMAN HAIN KHUDAYI ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
<br>
ABBAS BAHEN TERI MUSEEBAT MEIN PADI HAIN BEDAAD KADI HAIN,<br>
 AA JALD GHADI MERI GIRAFTARI KI AAYI ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
<br>
HYDER KI BAHU BETIYAONKE KHULTE HAIN AB SAR HOTA NAHI MEHSHAR,<br>
 AB LAYEQEY PARDA NAHI ZEHRA KI YE JAAYI ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
<br>
QASIM SE KAHO RAAT KI BIYAHI KI QABAR LE MARTI HAI WO GHAM SE,<br>
 AKBAR HO KAHAN AAO NAHI TAAB JUDAI ALLAH DUHAYI<br>
<br>
TAQDEER MEIN YE KUCH THA ABHI KYA HAI KHABAR KYA TUM CHAL BASEY BHAIYYA,<br>
 AB KYA KARON DETA NAHIN KUCH MUJH KO SUJHAYI ALLAH DUHAYI..